  "details": "i like that vrchat now has a way to make imposters of avatars on the website. but it would be nice if it would just automatically make imposters of all uploaded avatars, so that literally all quest and mobile users can see what PC people are wearing.\n\nalso, if we could also wear imposters while on mobile phone.\n\ni am a PC user, so am always in PC avatars, but then when i open the phone app, i need to change out of my avatar and into just some random public fallback. the avatar options are super limited. so it would be awesome if, when logging into the phone app, it would just plop us into the imposter version of our usual avatar",
